{"t":"CENX","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"Century Aluminum Company","ko":null,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Aluminum","employees":2906,"hq":"Chicago, IL, United States","website":"https://centuryaluminum.com","summary_en":"Century Aluminum Company, together with its subsidiaries, produces primary aluminum and alumina in the United States and Iceland. The company engages in the production of standard-grade and value-added primary aluminum products. It also owns and operates a carbon anode production facility in Vlissingen, the Netherlands; and operates aluminum reduction facilities or smelters; and bauxite mining and alumina refining in Jamaica. The company was founded in 1995 and is headquartered in Chicago, Illinois.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Century Aluminium Company는 자회사와 함께 미국과 아이슬란드에서 1차 알루미늄과 알루미나를 생산합니다. 이 회사는 표준 등급 및 부가가치가 높은 1차 알루미늄 제품을 생산하고 있습니다. 또한 네덜란드 Vlissingen에 탄소 양극 생산 시설을 소유 및 운영하고 있습니다. 알루미늄 환원 시설 또는 제련소를 운영합니다. 자메이카의 보크사이트 채굴 및 알루미나 정제. 이 회사는 1995년에 설립되었으며 일리노이주 시카고에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":30.68,"mcap":3037114368.0,"pe":3.6009388,"fpe":2.9140534,"peg":null,"ps":1.0136554,"pb":1.7740257,"ev_ebitda":4.117,"div":0.0,"beta":2.178,"hi52":70.43,"lo52":27.01},"fin":{"rev":2996199936.0,"rev_g":0.52,"eps_g":18.395,"gross":0.24424,"op":0.21067,"net":0.29684,"roe":0.68254995,"fcf":190587504.0,"cash":713000000.0,"debt":480300000.0,"de":26.01,"eps":8.52,"feps":10.52829},"own":{"short":0.1339,"inst":0.77566004,"insider":0.30885},"analyst":{"n":5,"mean":55.8,"median":55.0,"high":71.0,"low":39.0,"rec":"none","recMean":null,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":4,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":4,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":4,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":4,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-09","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight",